# dbt

## Naming

- Models: `stg_<source>__<entity>`, `dim_<entity>`, `fct_<entity>`, `int_<source>__<topic>`, `snap_<source>_<table>`.
- Columns: `snake_case`. Booleans start with `is_` or `has_`. Timestamps end with `_at`. Dates end with `_date`.

## Where rules live (do not re-derive here)

- Layer contract and dim/fact qualification: [dbt_project/docs/layering.md](../../dbt_project/docs/layering.md).
- Testing policy per layer (staging, base, core, intermediate, marts), materialization, CI gate, change management: [dbt_project/docs/engineering_standards.md](../../dbt_project/docs/engineering_standards.md).

## Tooling

- Run `sqlfluff lint models/<path>` from inside `dbt_project/`, not from the repo root, so the dbt templater picks up `.sqlfluff`.
